        "title": "Lunghezze",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 147932,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scopriamo come contare gli elementi negli array e usare queste informazioni in modo intelligente in un gioco.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 147933,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usiamo la parola <code>length</code> dopo il nome dell'array e un punto <code>.</code> per ottenere il numero di elementi in un array.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies.length);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 147934,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Prova tu: inizia con il nome dell'array, aggiungi un punto <code>.</code> e poi <code>length</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"items\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"70\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies.length);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>enemies</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e infine <code>length</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 147935,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi <code>console.log()</code> intorno a <code>enemies.length</code> per visualizzare la lunghezza dell'array <code>enemies</code> nella console.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies.length);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>console.log</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 147936,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo anche memorizzare la lunghezza di un array in una variabile.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" length = enemies.length;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(length);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 147937,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea una variabile <code>length</code> e memorizzaci la lunghezza dell'array.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"items\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"73\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" length = enemies.length;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(length);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>length</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>enemies.length</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 147938,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Indipendentemente da quanti elementi ci siano in un array, <code>length</code> li conterà per noi.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;skeleton&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;orc&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies.length);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 147939,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Prova tu: conta gli elementi nell'array <code>enemies</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"howMany\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"89\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;skeleton&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;orc&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies.length);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>enemies</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e infine <code>length</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 147940,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Anche se l'array <code>enemies</code> è vuoto, <code>enemies.length</code> ci restituisce il numero di elementi che contiene.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies.length);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 147941,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Memorizza un array vuoto in <code>enemies</code> per vedere che la sua lunghezza è <code>0</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies.length);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>[</code>, seguito da <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 147942,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare la lunghezza di un array per creare <strong>istruzioni condizionali</strong> che dipendono dal numero dei suoi elementi.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (enemies.length &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemies incoming!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 147943,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Prova: visualizza il messaggio solo se <code>enemies.length</code> è maggiore di <code>0</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (enemies.length &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemies incoming!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>enemies.length</code>, seguito da <code>&gt;</code> e infine <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 147944,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo anche usare la lunghezza di un array per creare <strong>cicli for</strong> che attraversano tutti i suoi elementi.</p><p>A questo scopo, ripetiamo un ciclo tante volte quanti sono gli elementi nell'array usando la proprietà <code>length</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; inventory.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 147945,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ripeti il ciclo for due volte specificando che <code>i</code> deve essere minore del <code>length</code> dell'array.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"i &gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; inventory.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>i &lt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 147946,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Esegui il ciclo for tre volte specificando che <code>i</code> deve essere minore di <code>inventory.length</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"83\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; inventory.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>i</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;</code> e infine <code>inventory.length</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 147947,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La variabile contatore, <code>i</code>, memorizza i valori <code>0</code>, <code>1</code> e <code>2</code> mentre il ciclo si ripete. Ma <code>0</code>, <code>1</code> e <code>2</code> sono anche gli <strong>indici</strong> degli elementi in <code>inventory</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 147948,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quindi, ogni volta che il ciclo si ripete, <code>i</code> contiene un <strong>indice</strong> di un elemento nell'array <code>inventory</code>. E possiamo usare l'indice per accedere all'elemento.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; inventory.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #18",
            "id": 147949,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Prova il ciclo: usa la variabile contatore, <code>i</code>, come indice per visualizzare tutti gli elementi di <code>inventory</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"x\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"121\" /><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"122\" /><option startIndex=\"122\" endIndex=\"123\" /><option startIndex=\"123\" endIndex=\"124\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;coin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; inventory.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>inventory</code>, seguito da <code>[</code> e poi <code>i</code>, <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
